{
  "id": "section-random-objects-table",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Random Objects table (d66)\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[22,22,49]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "11 Rope. May be used to climb down a height or to tie up a prisoner.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[22,49,118]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "12\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[22,118,121]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Religious symbol. Asymbol of any religion of your choice may be required\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[22,121,194]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "for certain rituals or used to focus your will and “turn” (repel) vampires if\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[22,194,272]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you have the Faith Skill. You may pick up a religious symbol every time you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[22,272,348]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "visit a place of worship. Negligible weight.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[22,348,393]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "13\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[22,393,396]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "First Aid Kit. Contains 1d6+2 first aid points. Each point may be used to\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[22,396,470]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "heal a single Life point after each encounter in which you lost at least 1\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[22,470,545]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Life. If you have the Medic Skill, you may use up to 3 first aid points per\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[22,545,621]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "encounter, or 4 if you have the Medic Skill (expert) level.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[22,621,681]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "14 Axe. See weapon summary table for rules.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[22,681,725]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "15\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[22,725,728]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "d6 Garlic heads. You may sacrifice 1 head to avoid an encounter with a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[22,728,799]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "vampire on a roll against the vampire’s level. If you are surprised by the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[22,799,874]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "vampire, you may NOT use garlic. Negligible weight.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[22,874,926]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "16\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[22,926,929]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0018",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Salt (6 doses) . 1 dose be sacrificed to avoid an attack when you are\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[22,929,999]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0019",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Escaping an encounter with a demon. May be thrown at monsters that are\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[22,999,1070]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0020",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "vulnerable to salt to inflict 2 damage. When you find Food points, you may\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[22,1070,1145]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0021",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "decide that 1 such Food point is 1 dose of salt. Negligible weight.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[22,1145,1213]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0022",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "21 Baseball bat. See weapons table.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[22,1213,1249]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0023",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "22 Lighter. May be used to light a candle, a torch or a molotov cocktail. May\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[22,1249,1327]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0024",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "also be useful in some rituals requiring fire. Negligible weight.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[22,1327,1393]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0025",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "23 Bundle of d6 wooden stakes. May be used to slay vampires stopping\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[22,1393,1462]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0026",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "their regeneration power. You need a hammer to use a stake effectively.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[22,1462,1534]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0027",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "24 Hammer. Used to nail down doors and windows and to drive stakes\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[22,1534,1601]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0028",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "through the hearts of vampires. It may also be used as a weapon.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[22,1601,1666]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0029",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "25 Exorcism ritual (book). Allows you to learn the Exorcism Arcane Skill if\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[22,1666,1742]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0030",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you have the Faith Skill.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[22,1742,1768]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0031",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "26 Backpack. Increases by 5 your limit of carried items and Food points.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[22,1768,1841]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0032",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "31\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[22,1841,1844]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0033",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Flashlight. This is a source of light; it may be used as a ranged weapon\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[22,1844,1917]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0034",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "to attack shadow creatures at +2, damage 1. After each encounter with\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[22,1917,1987]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0035",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "shadow creatures, there is a 1 in 6 chance of the batteries running out.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[22,1987,2060]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0036",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "32 Silver necklace. Negligible weight. You may turn it into d3 silver bullets if\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[22,2060,2141]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0037",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you find smelting equipment.",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[22,2141,2169]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0038",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "33  d6 Food points. You may decide that 1 Food is 1 dose of salt instead.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[23,22,96]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0039",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "34 d3 vials of holy water . This may be sacrificed and thrown against any\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[23,96,170]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0040",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "demon or non-zombie Undead, automatically hitting for 2 points of damage.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[23,170,244]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0041",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "35\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[23,244,247]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0042",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Spray Can . If you have a lighter, you may use this as an improvised\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[23,247,316]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0043",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "flamethrower, automatically inflicting 2 points of damage against any target\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[23,316,393]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0044",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "or 3 points of damage against any target that is vulnerable to fire.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[23,393,462]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0045",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "36 Shovel. Useful to dig graves or as a two-handed melee weapon.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[23,462,527]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0046",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "41 Flute. May be used to play music and perform certain rituals.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[23,527,592]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0047",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "42\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[23,592,595]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0048",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Rubber Mask. Roll a die, on a 1-3 it is the face of a politician, on a 4-6  a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[23,595,673]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0049",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "classic Halloween monster. They say certain monsters may not attack you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[23,673,745]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0050",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "if they cannot see your face. Negligible weight.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[23,745,794]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0051",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "43 Train ticket. Negligible weight.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[23,794,830]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0052",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "44 d6+3 candles. Used for many rituals. You need a lighter or other source\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[23,830,905]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0053",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "of fire to light them.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[23,905,928]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0054",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "45\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[23,928,931]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0055",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Random book. Roll 2d6 on the Book Table. If you begin the game with a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[23,931,1001]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0056",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "book, you already read it but you still cannot begin the game with any\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[23,1001,1072]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0057",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Arcane Skills (but you may learn any Arcane Skill taught by the book as\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[23,1072,1144]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0058",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "soon as you have enough XP to pay its cost).\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[23,1144,1189]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0059",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "46 d6 shotgun shells. Ammo for a shotgun.You may turn one into a silver\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[23,1189,1261]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0060",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "shell if you load it with a silver ring or silver necklace.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[23,1261,1321]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0061",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "51 Rat poison. Useful if you venture in the sewers.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[23,1321,1373]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0062",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "52 Leather jacket with a flaming skull motif printed on the back. Negligible\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[23,1373,1450]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0063",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "weight if worn, counts as 1 carried object otherwise.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[23,1450,1504]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0064",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "53 Insecticide. Useful against bug-like creatures.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[23,1504,1555]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0065",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "54 Samurai sword. Roll d6, on a 1 or 2 it is an authentic antique weapon,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[23,1555,1629]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0066",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "on a 3-6 is a cheap replica. See weapon summary table.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[23,1629,1684]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0067",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "55\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[23,1684,1687]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0068",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "d6 cans of dog food. May be used as 1 Food point each (yuck!) or\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[23,1687,1752]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0069",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "sacrificed to avoid an encounter with any canine creature (not\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[23,1752,1815]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0070",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "werewolves).\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[23,1815,1828]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0071",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "56 Creepy looking doll.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[23,1828,1852]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0072",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "61 Computer print-out. Somebody printed out a whole book. Roll on the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[23,1852,1922]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0073",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Random Book table, rerolling any result of 2 or 12.",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[23,1922,1973]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0074",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "62\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[24,22,25]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0075",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Journal. Keeping a journal will help you focus and learn from your\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[24,25,92]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0076",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "experience. If you have a journal, every time you accumulate 5 XP, you gain\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[24,92,168]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0077",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "1 extra XP.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[24,168,180]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0078",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "63\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[24,180,183]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0079",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Crescent shaped silver amulet.  May be used to create 2 silver bullets if\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[24,183,257]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0080",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you have smelting equipment. If worn, it gives you +1 to Escape rolls against\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[24,257,335]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0081",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "werewolves.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[24,335,347]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0082",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "64 Box of nails. May be useful to nail shut a coffin and also for some spells.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[24,347,426]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0083",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "65 Black mirror. Useful for some rituals.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[24,426,468]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0084",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "66 Smelting equipment. Counts as 2 carried items. You may create silver\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[24,468,540]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-random-objects-table:p0085",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "bullets if you have any silver item.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[24,540,577]]"
    }
  ],
